rry  but also bearing the stories of the  horrors unfolding in the cities that  they're fleeing  the people escaping mario paul it's one  of the few ways now that the world can  learn what's happening in their city  new satellite images show the theater  and mario poles surrounded by burning  buildings rescue workers still unable to  reach a thousand civilians thought to be  trapped under its rubble  the most frightening thing is that the  world will forget about mario  that they will talk about us for a day  two days and then mariupol citizens will  be just dying there in the basements  she's escaped with a message from mario  paul don't forget about us  sally lockwood sky news la viv in  western ukraine
 

